# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The whole repo root is the deploy output (no build step), so development
# files would otherwise be publicly readable on the production domain.
# CLAUDE.md in particular carries the firm's internal editorial rules and
# signed-off decisions — not secret, but it has no business being served
# from a domain we promote publicly.
#
# Pages only honours 3xx statuses and 200 proxies here — a `404` status is
# rejected and the rule ignored (verified live: the asset kept serving). So
# proxy these paths to the 404 page instead: the response is a 200, but the
# dev-file content is never served, and _headers marks the same paths
# X-Robots-Tag: noindex so the 200 cannot be indexed as a soft-404.
/CLAUDE.md                /404.html  200
/tax-engine.test.cjs      /404.html  200
/tax-engine.baseline.json /404.html  200
